le takes on this paper. While I’m at it, I’ll remind readers that suicide risk assessment is important, and no one does a better job of explaining it than Dr. Tyler Black:\n\nThank you for listening! Please share this podcast with your friends drop a a 5-star review on Apple Podcasts. It drives discovery like woah.\n\nShare"}